5. Use tax planning strategies: Tax planning strategies can help you optimize your tax situation. For example, you can use accrual accounting instead of cash accounting to delay the recognition of income and reduce your tax liability.

It's important to note that tax avoidance techniques should only be used if they are legal and ethical. If you're unsure whether a particular technique is legal or ethical, consult with a tax professional.
